  (text "Order 6SL5510-1BB11-0AA0. X131 and X108 are the PTI standard drive.\nSTO pin order is taken from the S200 PN sheet. Confirm the PTI sheet.\nX130 is the STO feedback. The terminal name on X130 is TODO.\nU1 is not a DIO pin. The pulse scale is TODO.\nThe brake coil stays on X108. There is no second holding means." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 10.16 12.70 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0fcaf4f6-ee26-586d-9b8d-add2b6d08069"))
